{
  "enabled": false,
  "name": "Pre-commit documentation check",
  "description": "在執行 git commit 前，提醒 agent 檢查是否已更新 docs/CHANGELOG.md 和 docs/DEV_NOTES.md。",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "preToolUse",
    "toolTypes": [
      "shell"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "如果這是 git commit 相關指令，先確認：(1) docs/CHANGELOG.md 是否已新增本次變更紀錄？(2) 若涉及架構決策或新陷阱，docs/DEV_NOTES.md 是否已更新？未完成則先更新文件再 commit。非 git commit 指令則直接執行。"
  }
}
